{#
  A CRM form as the fragment of the UiKit remote form dialog (0.8.0): "New company / New contact"
  (`ui.record_create: dialog`), "New tag" and "New field" (`ui.admin_create: dialog`). Answered to the form's own URL
  with `X-Nowo-Dialog: 1` (200) and to an invalid submission (422, re-rendered in the dialog, focus on the first invalid
  field). Same route, field names and CSRF token as the page. The Save / Cancel row (`data-nowo-ui-dialog-actions`)
  moves into the dialog footer; Cancel is a `type="button"` that closes the dialog. The form is named by the dialog
  title (`<dialog id>-title`).
  Variables: form (FormView), action (the URL the form posts to), dialog (the dialog id), testid, submit (translation
  key, default form.save); 0.9.0: intro (text above the fields, e.g. the question of a confirm, or null), variant
  (the submit's theme slot, default btn_primary; btn_danger for a destructive confirm, whose Cancel takes `autofocus`:
  the safe action gets the first focus).
#}
{%- set _b = 'NowoCrmKitBundle' -%}
<div data-testid="{{ testid }}">
    {{ form_start(form, {action: action, attr: {class: nowo_ui_class('form', _b), 'aria-labelledby': dialog ~ '-title', id: dialog ~ '-form'}}) }}
    {% if intro|default(null) %}<p data-testid="{{ testid }}-intro">{{ intro }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if form.vars.errors|length > 0 %}<div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('flash_error', _b) }}" role="alert" data-testid="{{ testid }}-errors">{{ form_errors(form) }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% for child in form %}{% if not child.rendered %}{{ form_row(child) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('form_actions', _b) }}" data-nowo-ui-dialog-actions>
        <button type="submit" class="{{ nowo_ui_class(variant|default('btn_primary'), _b) }}" data-testid="{{ testid }}-submit">{{ (submit ?? 'form.save')|trans({}, _b) }}</button>
        <button type="button" class="{{ nowo_ui_class('btn_secondary', _b) }}" data-nowo-ui-dialog-close data-testid="{{ testid }}-cancel"{% if variant|default('btn_primary') == 'btn_danger' %} autofocus{% endif %}>{{ 'form.cancel'|trans({}, _b) }}</button>
    </div>
    {{ form_end(form) }}
</div>
